<section id="about">
<h2>About Us</h2>
<p><strong>EducationCHV Organisation</strong> is a community-based organization based in Kericho, Rift Valley, Kenya. Our mission is to bridge the gap in healthcare by providing continuous education, digital tools and resources to Community Health Volunteers (CHVs).</p>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><h3>🎓 Our Mission</h3><p>To empower CHVs with knowledge and skills to improve maternal health, child health and disease prevention.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>👁️ Our Vision</h3><p>A healthy community where every household has access to a trained and motivated health volunteer.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>💚 Our Values</h3><p>Compassion, Integrity, Service, Education and Community First.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="services" style="background:#ecfdf5">
<h2>What We Do</h2>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card"><h3>Training & Workshops</h3><p>Monthly trainings on first aid, maternal health, nutrition and data reporting.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Digital Health Education</h3><p>We create simple learning materials in English and Swahili for CHVs.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Community Outreach</h3><p>Health camps, school health programs and door-to-door health education in Kericho County.</p></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="donate">
<h2>Support Our Work</h2>
<p>Your support helps us train more CHVs, print materials and reach remote villages. Every shilling counts.</p>

<div class="mpesa-box">
<h3>LIPA NA M-PESA</h3>
<p>Paybill Number</p>
<div class="paybill">522522</div>
<p>Account Number: <strong>EDUCATIONCHV</strong></p>
<p style="margin-top:15px;font-size:0.9rem">Go to M-Pesa > Lipa na M-Pesa > Paybill > Enter Business No. and Account</p>
<p style="margin-top:10px">OR Till Number: <strong>123456</strong></p>
<a href="tel:*334#" class="btn" style="margin-top:20px">Donate Now</a>
</div>
<p style="text-align:center;margin-top:15px">**Replace 522522 / 123456 with your real Paybill/Till above**</p>
</section>

<section id="contact">
